{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@4160","endTime":357955.076,"result":{"value":"All projects\nMOBILE EXPERIENCE / 05\nDigital Habit Tracker.\n\nA habit-tracking interface with routine lists, calendar context, and a visual progress overview.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nMobile apps\nFOCUS\nHabits & routines\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nMake daily progress visible.\n\nDigital Habit Tracker’s mobile presentation connects daily routines with a calendar and progress-focused dashboard. The supplied screens include an introductory view, account entry, and a personalized home screen. Routine items and summary graphics make the habit-oriented purpose visible in the interface itself.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Digital Habit Tracker's original project material.\n\n01\nRoutine list\n\nDaily activities appear as individual items in the home interface.\n\n02\nCalendar context\n\nA compact date view connects routines to the current period.\n\n03\nProgress graphic\n\nA circular visualization summarizes the displayed activity.\n\n04\nOnboarding screens\n\nIntroductory and sign-in layouts establish the account journey.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nHabits & routines\n\nPurple gradients and soft white cards give the product a distinct identity. Circular progress graphics provide contrast to the linear routine list, while compact date controls keep time and daily activity close together.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Digital Habit Tracker.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n01\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n02\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n03\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n04\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT MOBILE PROJECT\nTukeeConnect\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nTEAM COMMUNICATION\nTukeeConnect\nGOLF & COURSE ACTIVITY\nPace of Play\nWORK RECORDS & DOCUMENTS\nQcop App\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
